Audit complete.

Verdict: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

Although both target claims reconstructed to `#Top`, the priority loop-summary rule proves a concrete false state transition involving closure cells. Fixed supplied semantics rejects the same transition and exposes the correct heap update.

Detailed findings: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)

Key evidence: [bridge-enabled witness](/audit-output/evidence/cell-witness-bridge.log), [fixed-semantics rejection](/audit-output/evidence/cell-witness-fixed.log), and [fresh non-vacuity test](/audit-output/evidence/vacuity-proof.log).
